(7439878, 1176375, 60495, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, not a great fit for the challenge in my opinion, if the image would have been just the peaks against the clouds that may have worked better as far as meeting the light on White challenge. Just my opinion but still a lovely image, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful image, not a great fit for the challenge in my opinion, if the image would have been just the peaks against the clouds that may have worked better as far as meeting the light on White challenge. Just my opinion but still a lovely image, good luck in the challenge.', '2016-02-27 17:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7439879, 1176350, 60495, '<td valign="top">I always love shots of the ice on the black sand, I especially love the way the beach seamlessly gives way to the water. As far as the challenge goes it just seems to dark overall to meet my interpretation of light on white but that''s just my opinion. Also the focus on the ice just seems a little soft but overall a pleasing image. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I always love shots of the ice on the black sand, I especially love the way the beach seamlessly gives way to the water. As far as the challenge goes it just seems to dark overall to meet my interpretation of light on white but that''s just my opinion. Also the focus on the ice just seems a little soft but overall a pleasing image. Good luck in the challenge.', '2016-02-27 17:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
